    "detailed_description": "Roam a post-apocalyptic desert world and conquer the ultimate survival challenge with Anarchy Racers: Fury Roads, a vehicular combat game where every upgrade and every battle shapes your path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0cabe8e74c03adb6dc4518ae6ac7186f.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0cabe8e74c03adb6dc4518ae6ac7186f.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transform Your Vehicle:</h2>Start with a standard car and transform it into a fearsome machine. Equip it with powerful exhausts, high-performance engines, reinforced buffers, deadly weapons, rugged wheels, and unique decorations. As you advance, unlock and customize a variety of new cars to match your evolving strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0e3b83c101edad58184670e5811ebdc7.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0e3b83c101edad58184670e5811ebdc7.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Anarchy Racing:</strong> Engage in adrenaline-pumping races. Navigate treacherous tracks and use weaponized vehicles to secure victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/e8d612f0894ea287c192925cf42bf073.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/e8d612f0894ea287c192925cf42bf073.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Arena Battle:</strong> Enter a gladiatorial arena where only the strongest survive. Battle against multiple cars in a last-car-standing showdown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/39a06c170a88bb8f81e51011664e0cbd.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/39a06c170a88bb8f81e51011664e0cbd.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Escort Mode:</strong> Safeguard a resource-laden truck from enemies. Defend your cargo using weapons and brute force to resist enemy attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0a4f4c9c3799bc37eb0440052a39815e.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0a4f4c9c3799bc37eb0440052a39815e.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Upgrade System:</h2>Customize and enhance every aspect of your car. From upgrading your engine for better performance to installing advanced weaponry for increased firepower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/702c328709aed2d39899a1a32972c4a0.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/702c328709aed2d39899a1a32972c4a0.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Environments:</h2>Each environment offers unique challenges and opportunities, encouraging strategic thinking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning Visuals and Sound:</h2>Feel every bump, crash, and explosion with detailed visual effects and dynamic audio.<br><br>Prepare for a ruthless fight for survival in a savage post-apocalyptic world where cars are the key to survival and rise as the ultimate desert warrior!",
    "about_the_game": "Roam a post-apocalyptic desert world and conquer the ultimate survival challenge with Anarchy Racers: Fury Roads, a vehicular combat game where every upgrade and every battle shapes your path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0cabe8e74c03adb6dc4518ae6ac7186f.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0cabe8e74c03adb6dc4518ae6ac7186f.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transform Your Vehicle:</h2>Start with a standard car and transform it into a fearsome machine. Equip it with powerful exhausts, high-performance engines, reinforced buffers, deadly weapons, rugged wheels, and unique decorations. As you advance, unlock and customize a variety of new cars to match your evolving strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0e3b83c101edad58184670e5811ebdc7.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0e3b83c101edad58184670e5811ebdc7.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Anarchy Racing:</strong> Engage in adrenaline-pumping races. Navigate treacherous tracks and use weaponized vehicles to secure victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/e8d612f0894ea287c192925cf42bf073.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/e8d612f0894ea287c192925cf42bf073.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Arena Battle:</strong> Enter a gladiatorial arena where only the strongest survive. Battle against multiple cars in a last-car-standing showdown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/39a06c170a88bb8f81e51011664e0cbd.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/39a06c170a88bb8f81e51011664e0cbd.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Escort Mode:</strong> Safeguard a resource-laden truck from enemies. Defend your cargo using weapons and brute force to resist enemy attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0a4f4c9c3799bc37eb0440052a39815e.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/0a4f4c9c3799bc37eb0440052a39815e.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Upgrade System:</h2>Customize and enhance every aspect of your car. From upgrading your engine for better performance to installing advanced weaponry for increased firepower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/702c328709aed2d39899a1a32972c4a0.poster.avif?t=1743590770\" width=615 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215380/extras/702c328709aed2d39899a1a32972c4a0.webm?t=1743590770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Environments:</h2>Each environment offers unique challenges and opportunities, encouraging strategic thinking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning Visuals and Sound:</h2>Feel every bump, crash, and explosion with detailed visual effects and dynamic audio.<br><br>Prepare for a ruthless fight for survival in a savage post-apocalyptic world where cars are the key to survival and rise as the ultimate desert warrior!",
